    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The University of Applied Sciences Europe (UE) in Amsterdam gives you a mix of theoretical learning with real-world experience. It offers a range of undergraduate and postgraduate courses in Business, Design, and Technology, attracting students from around the world.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Your student life at UE Amsterdam is dynamic and inclusive. You’ll find students from all corners of the world, engaging in various cultural events, festivals, and student-run initiatives.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>UE Amsterdam does not have its own student housing; instead, it has agreements with various housing providers for accommodation.</p>",
